{{!-- Author: Rasel Al Mamun --}}
{{!-- Portfolio icons (FD-107), decorative: the text beside each one names it. In-house line icons:
24 px box, 1.5 px stroke in currentColor, rounded caps (.icon). The ORCID iD is ORCID's official
monochrome iD icon (filled, currentColor), used only to link to the author's ORCID record as ORCID's
brand guidelines allow; path data from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0), see docs/security.md. LinkedIn and
GitHub are the footer's official marks (footer-icon.hbs).
Usage: {{> icons/pf-icon name="pin"}} — pin, external, trophy, medal, ribbon, briefcase,
mortarboard, chip, network, code, gear, document, orcid, scholar, scopus, researchgate, wos, linkedin,
github, download, link (the generic icon for any link type without its own, FD-151). 1.7.1 (added, not
used by the content yet): expertise handshake, government, chart-up, team, graduation (the mortarboard
drawing), book, globe, bulb, megaphone, shield, heart (briefcase was already here); awards star,
certificate. `size` sets the box (default 24). --}}
{{#if (or (eq name "linkedin") (eq name "github"))}}
{{> icons/footer-icon name=name}}
{{else if (eq name "orcid")}}
<svg class="icon pf-icon pf-mark" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="{{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}24{{/if}}" height="{{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}24{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
